---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="单品深度评测 - 机场测速与跑路预警 | 老叶实测"
	description="不吹不黑，老叶自费购买机场，为您带来最真实的晚高峰测速、Netflix解锁测试以及跑路风险评估。拒绝软文，只说真话。"
>
	<main class="flex-1 bg-slate-50 pb-24">
		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 py-16">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
				<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">
					老叶深度评测室
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
					自费购买，晚高峰挂机实测。是真专线还是杀猪盘？在这里，老叶只用数据说话。
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Content Section -->
		<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
			<div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
				
				<!-- Shanyue Review Card -->
				<a href="/reviews/shanyue" class="group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-amber-500">
					<div class="aspect-[16/9] bg-slate-100 relative overflow-hidden">
						<!-- 使用首页已有的闪跃测速图作为封面图 -->
						<img src="/images/shanyue-speedtest1.png" alt="闪跃机场测速" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" />
						<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/60 to-transparent"></div>
						<div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 flex gap-2">
							<span class="rounded bg-amber-500 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-sm">IPLC专线</span>
							<span class="rounded bg-white/90 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm">深度评测</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors line-clamp-2">
							闪跃机场怎么样？跑路了吗？2026 最新晚高峰实测与 IPLC 专线评测
						</h2>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 flex-1">
							十几块钱买纯正 IPLC 专线，到底是杀猪盘还是真慈善？老叶连续挂机一个月，带你揭秘晚高峰 4K 拖拽秒开的真相。
						</p>
						<div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">
							<span>🔥 强推</span>
							<span>•</span>
							<span>老叶原创</span>
							<span>•</span>
							<span>最近更新</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>

				<!-- Placeholder for future reviews -->
				<!-- Yifanyun Review Card -->
				<a href="/reviews/yifanyun" class="group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-emerald-500">
					<div class="aspect-[16/9] bg-slate-800 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
						<img src="/images/yifanyun-topology.png" alt="一翻云入口与落地机房拓扑图" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" />
						<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/60 to-transparent"></div>
						<div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 flex gap-2">
							<span class="rounded bg-emerald-500 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-sm">节点拓扑分析</span>
							<span class="rounded bg-white/90 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm">硬核拆解</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors line-clamp-2">
							老鸟专供：一翻云到底是不是大厂？一张入口与落地拓扑图带你看清真相
						</h2>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 flex-1">
							别看全绿的测速图，看底层架构！一翻云日本节点采用昂贵 DODO K.K. 顶级机房，上海电信优质入口直连，大厂实力实锤。
						</p>
						<div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">
							<span>🥈 备用老牌</span>
							<span>•</span>
							<span>老叶原创</span>
							<span>•</span>
							<span>硬核干货</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>

				<!-- Kuajieyun Review Card -->
				<a href="/reviews/kuajieyun" class="group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-orange-500">
					<div class="aspect-[16/9] bg-slate-100 relative overflow-hidden">
						<!-- 跨界云测速图 -->
						<img src="/images/kuajieyun-speedtest1.png" alt="跨界云机场测速" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" />
						<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/60 to-transparent"></div>
						<div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 flex gap-2">
							<span class="rounded bg-orange-500 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-sm">入门级IPLC</span>
							<span class="rounded bg-white/90 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm">深度评测</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors line-clamp-2">
							跨界云机场怎么样？20块钱买 IPLC 专线是交智商税吗？老叶实测
						</h2>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 flex-1">
							打着极简口号的跨界云，门槛极低，到底好不好用？老叶带你看它的真实水平，不吹不黑，只适合一类人。
						</p>
						<div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">
							<span>🥉 备用</span>
							<span>•</span>
							<span>老叶原创</span>
							<span>•</span>
							<span>最近更新</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>

				<!-- Feimaoyun Review Card -->
				<a href="/reviews/feimaoyun" class="group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-emerald-500">
					<div class="aspect-[16/9] bg-slate-100 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
						<img src="/images/feimaoyun-cover.png" alt="飞猫云实测封面" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" />
						<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/60 to-transparent"></div>
						<div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 flex gap-2">
							<span class="rounded bg-emerald-500 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-sm">节点覆盖王</span>
							<span class="rounded bg-white/90 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm">深度评测</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors line-clamp-2">
							飞猫云机场怎么样？2026 最新晚高峰实测与 IEPL 专线评测
						</h2>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 flex-1">
							50多个国家地区的节点覆盖，这绝对是冷门需求和外贸党的福音。老叶带你看看飞猫云的真实实力。
						</p>
						<div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">
							<span>🌎 全球覆盖</span>
							<span>•</span>
							<span>老叶原创</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>

				<!-- Weituyun Review Card -->
				<a href="/reviews/weituoyun" class="group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-blue-500">
					<div class="aspect-[16/9] bg-slate-100 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
						<img src="/images/weituoyun-cover.png" alt="唯兔云实测封面" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" />
						<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/60 to-transparent"></div>
						<div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 flex gap-2">
							<span class="rounded bg-blue-500 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-sm">SLA 保证</span>
							<span class="rounded bg-white/90 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm">深度评测</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors line-clamp-2">
							唯兔云机场怎么样？99.9% 连通率保证是吹牛吗？老叶实测
						</h2>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 flex-1">
							敢写 99.9% 连通率 SLA 保证的硬核机场。不仅套餐极其丰富，特有的“永久不限时套餐”更是轻度用户的防失联神器。
						</p>
						<div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">
							<span>🛡️ 极度稳定</span>
							<span>•</span>
							<span>老叶原创</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>

				<!-- Kuaili Review Card -->
				<a href="/reviews/kuaili" class="group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-purple-500">
					<div class="aspect-[16/9] bg-slate-100 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
						<img src="/images/kuaili-speedtest.png.jpg" alt="快狸测速截图" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" />
						<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/60 to-transparent"></div>
						<div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 flex gap-2">
							<span class="rounded bg-purple-500 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-sm">平价优质</span>
							<span class="rounded bg-white/90 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm">深度评测</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-purple-600 transition-colors line-clamp-2">
							快狸机场怎么样？15元入门的 IEPL 专线体验报告
						</h2>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 flex-1">
							节点覆盖广泛且价格非常亲民。15 元的月狸套餐入门门槛极低，究竟体验如何？老叶实测为你揭秘。
						</p>
						<div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">
							<span>💰 性价比</span>
							<span>•</span>
							<span>老叶原创</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>

				<!-- Firefly Review Card -->
				<a href="/reviews/firefly" class="group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-red-500">
					<div class="aspect-[16/9] bg-slate-100 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
						<img src="/images/firefly-speedtest1.png.jpg" alt="Firefly测速截图" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" />
						<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/60 to-transparent"></div>
						<div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 flex gap-2">
							<span class="rounded bg-red-500 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-sm">高端必选</span>
							<span class="rounded bg-white/90 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm">深度评测</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-red-600 transition-colors line-clamp-2">
							Firefly 机场怎么样？高端发烧友必看的 IPLC 专线测评
						</h2>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 flex-1">
							主打高端市场的 IPLC 专线，适合那些不差钱、对网络有着极致苛刻要求的高端玩家。一分钱一分货，我们看数据。
						</p>
						<div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">
							<span>💎 高端体验</span>
							<span>•</span>
							<span>老叶原创</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>

			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
